            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A cleaner includes: at least one cyclone configured to separate dust from suctioned air; a dust container configured to store the dust separated by the cyclone; a dust compressor provided inside the dust container and configured to compress the dust stored in the dust container; and a lifter configured to move the dust compressor upward and downward within the dust container.</p>
